# Wetlands - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 8 confirmed flagged rares of the Wetlands
# and its fixed world containers. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is
# not up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE
# dropper is the rare. Single-point rares get plain steps; the two
# multi-point rares loop over ALL their confirmed points (a loop needs at
# least two). Razormaw Matriarch sits one level above the core band
# (31 vs 20-30) and says so plainly - come back at a higher level. No tame
# lines ship (the data has no tameability flag and the core guide carries no
# tame corroboration - see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are
# unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. No rare in this guide is a
# giver, ender, or objective of any core-contracted quest; the zone's named
# quest mobs without the flag (Balgaras, Captain Halyndor) are deliberately
# excluded - see docs/wetlands-companions-inventory.md.
guide butler-routes-completionist/wetlands-rares
title Wetlands - Rares & Treasures
levels 20-30
zone Wetlands
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords wetlands, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Ma'ruk Wyrmscale — the south

  zone map 1437

  goto 48.06,74.70
  kill 2090 optional
  collect 5749 "Scythe Axe" optional
  collect 5750 "Warchief's Girdle" optional
  note Level 23 rare at its single confirmed point in the south; its sole drops are the Scythe Axe and the Warchief's Girdle. No quest takes either in the data.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

